    很 | hěn | very | Has 彳 (step) on the left instead of 钅
    狠 | hěn | ruthless; ferocious | Has 犭 (dog) on the left instead of 钅
    恨 | hèn | hate; regret | Has 忄 (heart) on the left instead of 钅
    根 | gēn | root; base | Has 木 (tree) on the left instead of 钅
  etymological_cognates[4]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
